 for hematologic malignancy", "Metastatic visceral mass syndrome: Weight loss and constitutional symptoms could suggest cancer, but blast count defines hematologic origin", "Diabetic complication syndrome: Neurological features might suggest peripheral neuropathy, but systemic findings (blasts, anemia) dominate the differential"], "alarm_features": ["Constitutional symptoms (fever, weight loss, night sweats)", "Pancytopenia with blasts", "Acute neurological decompensation (visual acuity decline, ataxia)"]}, "branches": {}, "frontier": [], "other_mass": 0.0, "differential_history": [], "interrupt": {"active": false, "reason": "", "required_actions": []}, "termination": {"ready_to_stop": false, "termination_type": "continue", "reason": ""}, "turn_budget_used": 0, "estimated_remaining_value": 0.0, "max_turn_budget": 5, "latest_action_type": "", "diagnosis_readiness_score": 0.0, "benchmark_output_ready": false, "static_question": "Which of the following is the most likely diagnosis?", "static_options": [{"id": "A", "description": "Acute lymphoblastic leukemia"}, {"id": "B", "description": "Acute myelogenous leukemia"}, {"id": "C", "description": "Chronic lymphocytic leukemia"}, {"id": "D", "description": "Chronic myelogenous leukemia"}, {"id": "E", "description": "Multiple myeloma"}], "seen_evidence_ids": [], "seen_evidence_phenotypes": "set()", "mode_policy": {"benchmark_purity": true, "allow_external_knowledge": true}, "answer_option_mapping": {}, "root_revision_needed": false, "max_tree_depth": 3, "reasoning_ledger": {"anchor": {}, "leader": {}, "leader_evidence": {}, "action_intents": [], "considered_alternatives": []}, "branch_knowledge": {"l1_classification_axis": "mechanism", "axis_rationale": "reactive vs neoplastic, then myeloid vs lymphoid vs plasma-cell — the standard haematologic mechanism axis (mirrors branch_creator.txt B1-B5 template).", "mandatory_coverage": ["reactive / non-malignant leukocytosis", "myeloid neoplasm (incl. MPN / blast-bearing)", "myeloid neoplasm with increased blasts / blast crisis (AML, MDS-EB, CML-BC)", "lymphoid neoplasm", "plasma cell disorder"], "candidate_entities_by_domain": {"myeloid neoplasm (incl. MPN / blast-bearing)": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"], "myeloid neoplasm with increased blasts / blast crisis (AML, MDS-EB, CML-BC)": ["acute myeloid leukemia", "myelodysplastic syndrome with excess blasts", "chronic myeloid leukemia in blast crisis"], "lymphoid neoplasm": ["acute lymphoblastic leukemia", "lymphoblastic lymphoma"]}, "syndrome_matched": "leukocytosis"}}
